  "hints": [
    "Special-case n == 0 to return \"0\" immediately.",
    "While n > 0, collect str(n % 2), halve n //= 2, then reverse the collected bits.",
    "Pseudocode:\n  if n == 0: return \"0\"\n  bits = []\n  while n > 0:\n      bits.append(str(n % 2)); n //= 2\n  return \"\".join(reversed(bits))"
  ],
